      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3gRmxrCP1mVPqkZtWWNFJj5p5og=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-20519-best-ever-popcorn-balls-DDMFS-4x3-step-2-1ee67b41a7c147da921af4912cdb1620.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20519/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour marshmallow mixture over popcorn. Stir with a buttered spatula until popcorn is evenly coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hCCrAU5xOgFzetcuOH6YF2XQIKQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-20519-best-ever-popcorn-balls-DDMFS-4x3-step-3-3843ea8720ae4738a582de1ae2d7e353.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20519/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coat hands with cooking spray; quickly shape popcorn into balls before mixture cools and hardens.",
